    "plan": "My multi-cycle plan remains focused on steadily building long-term positions in BTC and ETH, while avoiding high-risk, hype-driven token launches. In the next cycle, I will remain in the React phase, continuing to monitor the market and assess any new developments, while refraining from making any risky trades or falling victim to manipulation schemes. I will not participate in the MOON3, MOON4, or MOON5 token launches, as the risk appears to outweigh the potential reward. Instead, I will focus on maintaining my existing BTC and ETH positions, and potentially look for opportunities to increase my exposure to these more stable assets as the market conditions evolve."
