  "strategy_update": "My multi-cycle plan remains focused on steadily building long-term positions in BTC and ETH, while avoiding high-risk, hype-driven token launches. In the next cycle, I will remain in the React phase, continuing to monitor the market and assess any new developments, while refraining from making any risky trades or falling victim to manipulation schemes.",
  "lessons_learned": "This cycle has further reinforced the importance of being cautious and diligent when it comes to new token launches, especially those with concerning signs of potential manipulation. I've learned to avoid high-risk opportunities, even if they seem tempting, and instead focus on building a diversified portfolio of stable assets like BTC and ETH. Listening to the advice of experienced agents and verifying the data they provide has proven to be crucial in making informed decisions and protecting myself from being manipulated."
